<node id="11144556" title="RFC: Policy regarding abuses of the voting system" created="2022-06-09 09:38:01" updated="2022-06-09 09:38:01" _doctext_mode="lenient"><type id="1036">monkdiscuss</type>
<author id="170442">jdporter</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;
I submit for your consideration:

&lt;h4&gt;Policy regarding abuses of the voting system&lt;/h4&gt;
The following behaviors are counter to the spirit of PerlMonks and are considered abuses of the voting system:
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt; Massive downvoting of nodes belonging some specific user. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt; The use of vote-bots for any reason. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt; Voting on nodes you (the human) wrote. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
Any violation of this policy will result in a suspension of your voting privileges, and may result in having your XP reduced by an amount [gods|we] deem appropriate.
&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If you suspect you have been the target of a malicious downvoting campaign, please [msg://gods]. We will look into it.
&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;small&gt;References:&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt; [id://651535] &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt; [id://103190] &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt; [id://538727] &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/small&gt;

&lt;/p&gt;
</doctext>
